      "hint": "",
      "explanation": "<p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span class=\"eq-highlight\">Từ loại cần điền:</span> <strong>tính từ</strong>, theo sau động từ \"<strong>be</strong>\" bổ nghĩa cho chủ ngữ, mô tả tính chất của việc dành quá nhiều thời gian cho thiết bị điện tử.</p>\n<style>\n    .vocab-table-sharp-wrapper {\n        width: 100%;\n        background-color: #ffffff; \n        border: 1px solid #ceedca;\n        border-radius: 10px; \n        overflow: hidden;\n    }\n\n    .vocab-table-sharp {\n        width: 100%;\n        border-collapse: collapse;\n        text-align: left;\n    }\n\n    .vocab-table-sharp td {\n        padding: 0.4rem 0.5rem;\n        color: #1c581f;\n        border-bottom: 1px solid #ceedca;\n        transition: background-color 0.3s ease;\n        vertical-align: top; \n        font-size: 14px;\n    }\n    \n    .vocab-table-sharp td:first-child {\n        border-right: 1px solid #ceedca;\n    }\n\n    .vocab-table-sharp tr:last-child td {\n        border-bottom: none;\n    }\n\n    .word-en-sharp {\n        margin-right: 0.4rem;\n        font-size: 14px; \n    }\n\n    .word-pos-sharp {\n        color: #5fbd18; \n        margin-right: 0.4rem;\n    }\n    \n    .word-pron-sharp {\n        color: #333333;\n    }\n\n    .example-sharp {\n        margin-top: 6px;\n        color: #555555;\n        line-height: 1.4;\n    }\n\n    .eq-highlight {\n        font-weight: bold;\n    }\n\n    .meaning-en-sharp {\n        margin-bottom: 8px;\n        color: #222222;\n    }\n</style>\n<div class=\"vocab-table-sharp-wrapper\">\n<table class=\"vocab-table-sharp\">\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 50%;\">\n<div style=\"margin-bottom: 8px;\"><strong><span class=\"word-en-sharp\">harm</span></strong><span class=\"word-pos-sharp\">(n., v.)</span><span class=\"word-pron-sharp\">/hɑːrm/</span></div>\n<div class=\"example-sharp\">The accident caused serious <span class=\"eq-highlight\">harm</span> to his leg.</div>\n</td>\n<td style=\"width: 50%;\">\n<div class=\"meaning-en-sharp\">physical or mental damage or injury; to damage or injure someone or something</div>\n<div><span style=\"color: #7e8c8d;\"><em>sự tổn hại, sự thiệt hại; làm hại, gây hại</em></span></div>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr style=\"background-color: #e5f6e3;\">\n<td style=\"width: 50%;\">\n<div style=\"margin-bottom: 8px;\"><strong><span class=\"word-en-sharp\">harmful</span></strong><span class=\"word-pos-sharp\">(adj.)</span><span class=\"word-pron-sharp\">/ˈhɑːrmfəl/</span></div>\n<div class=\"example-sharp\">Exposure to the sun's UV rays can be <span class=\"eq-highlight\">harmful</span>.</div>\n</td>\n<td style=\"width: 50%;\">\n<div class=\"meaning-en-sharp\">causing or likely to cause harm</div>\n<div><span style=\"color: #7e8c8d;\"><em>có hại, gây hại</em></span></div>\n</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n</div>\n<details style=\"margin-top: 10px;\">\n<summary style=\"cursor: pointer; color: #5fbd18; font-weight: bold; padding: 5px 0;\">Xem thêm các từ cùng gốc khác</summary>\n<div class=\"vocab-table-sharp-wrapper\" style=\"margin-top: 5px;\">\n<table class=\"vocab-table-sharp\" style=\"height: 172px;\">\n<tbody>\n<tr style=\"height: 43px;\">\n<td style=\"width: 703px; height: 43px;\">\n<div style=\"margin-bottom: 8px;\"><strong><span class=\"word-en-sharp\">harmfully</span></strong><span class=\"word-pos-sharp\">(adv.)</span><span class=\"word-pron-sharp\">/ˈhɑːrmfəli/</span></div>\n<div class=\"example-sharp\">The chemicals were <span class=\"eq-highlight\">harmfully</span> released into the environment.</div>\n</td>\n<td style=\"width: 703px; height: 43px;\">\n<div class=\"meaning-en-sharp\">in a way that causes harm</div>\n<div><span style=\"color: #7e8c8d;\"><em>một cách có hại, gây hại</em></span></div>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr style=\"height: 43px;\">\n<td style=\"width: 703px; height: 43px;\">\n<div style=\"margin-bottom: 8px;\"><strong><span class=\"word-en-sharp\">harmless</span></strong><span class=\"word-pos-sharp\">(adj.)</span><span class=\"word-pron-sharp\">/ˈhɑːrmləs/</span></div>\n<div class=\"example-sharp\">The snake was completely <span class=\"eq-highlight\">harmless</span>.</div>\n</td>\n<td style=\"width: 703px; height: 43px;\">\n<div class=\"meaning-en-sharp\">not causing any harm or injury</div>\n<div><span style=\"color: #7e8c8d;\"><em>vô hại, không gây hại</em></span></div>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr style=\"height: 43px;\">\n<td style=\"width: 703px; height: 43px;\">\n<div style=\"margin-bottom: 8px;\"><strong><span class=\"word-en-sharp\">harmlessly</span></strong><span class=\"word-pos-sharp\">(adv.)</span><span class=\"word-pron-sharp\">/ˈhɑːrmləsli/</span></div>\n<div class=\"example-sharp\">The child played <span class=\"eq-highlight\">harmlessly</span> with the toy.</div>\n</td>\n<td style=\"width: 703px; height: 43px;\">\n<div class=\"meaning-en-sharp\">in a way that causes no harm</div>\n<div><span style=\"color: #7e8c8d;\"><em>một cách vô hại, không gây hại</em></span></div>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr style=\"height: 43px;\">\n<td style=\"width: 703px; height: 43px;\">\n<div style=\"margin-bottom: 8px;\"><strong><span class=\"word-en-sharp\">unharmed</span></strong><span class=\"word-pos-sharp\">(adj.)</span><span class=\"word-pron-sharp\">/ʌnˈhɑːrmd/</span></div>\n<div class=\"example-sharp\">Despite the crash, he walked away <span class=\"eq-highlight\">unharmed</span>.</div>\n</td>\n<td style=\"width: 703px; height: 43px;\">\n<div class=\"meaning-en-sharp\">not hurt or damaged</div>\n<div><span style=\"color: #7e8c8d;\"><em>không bị tổn hại, không bị thương</em></span></div>\n</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n</div>\n</details>",
