      "questionName": "e-reader, smartwatch, cardboard, window shade",
      "questionType": "FillBlank",
      "questionText": "<p><strong>Write suitable words to complete the conversation.</strong></p>\n<p><img src=\"/images/exams/set_3_-_electronic_devices_8e0ed607.png\" alt width=\"500\"></p>\n<p>Sarah: Hey, Tom! I saw a <strong><span class='fillblank-option'><label>13.1</label><input id='fbo-910830-0' class='ms fillblank-option-13' index='0' name='fbo-910830-0' type='text' size='13' autocomplete='off' data-testid='fillblank-input-910830-0' /></span></strong> box at the entrance this morning. Is that yours?</p>\n<p>Tom: Hi, Sarah! It's mine. It&#8217;s the <strong><span class='fillblank-option'><label>13.2</label><input id='fbo-910830-1' class='ms fillblank-option-13' index='1' name='fbo-910830-1' type='text' size='10' autocomplete='off' data-testid='fillblank-input-910830-1' /></span></strong> I bought two days ago.</p>\n<p>Sarah: Wow, it's great! Where did you get it? I&#8217;ve been thinking about buying one.</p>\n<p>Tom: I ordered it online. It was a great deal. It can connect to my phone.</p>\n<p>Sarah: That&#8217;s cool! So, you can control it with your phone?</p>\n<p>Tom: Yes, exactly. I can also use my phone to control other things, like closing the <strong><span class='fillblank-option'><label>13.3</label><input id='fbo-910830-2' class='ms fillblank-option-13' index='2' name='fbo-910830-2' type='text' size='16' autocomplete='off' data-testid='fillblank-input-910830-2' /></span></strong> without touching it.</p>\n<p>Sarah: That sounds amazing! I don't know if our phones can work that way.</p>\n<p>Tom: The technology is developing every day. Now you can even use a <strong><span class='fillblank-option'><label>13.4</label><input id='fbo-910830-3' class='ms fillblank-option-13' index='3' name='fbo-910830-3' type='text' size='14' autocomplete='off' data-testid='fillblank-input-910830-3' /></span></strong> to control things without the phone.</p>\n<p>Sarah: Really? I need to get one.&nbsp;</p>",
