      "questionText": "<p style=\"text-align: justify;\" data-start=\"0\" data-end=\"300\"><strong>Read the following passage and choose the option that best fits each blank.</strong></p>\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\" data-start=\"0\" data-end=\"300\">Using electronic devices for long periods can cause various <strong><span class='fillblank-option'><label>14.1</label><select class='ms fillblank-option-14' index='0' name='fbo-910835-0' data-testid='fillblank-select-910835-0'><option value='' data-testid='fillblank-option-empty-910835-0'></option><option value=\"communication\" data-testid='fillblank-option-910835-0-communication'>communication</option><option value=\"technology\" data-testid='fillblank-option-910835-0-technology'>technology</option><option value=\"health\" data-testid='fillblank-option-910835-0-health'>health</option><option value=\"management\" data-testid='fillblank-option-910835-0-management'>management</option></select></span></strong> problems. One issue is <strong><span class='fillblank-option'><label>14.2</label><select class='ms fillblank-option-14' index='1' name='fbo-910835-1' data-testid='fillblank-select-910835-1'><option value='' data-testid='fillblank-option-empty-910835-1'></option><option value=\"stress\" data-testid='fillblank-option-910835-1-stress'>stress</option><option value=\"fever\" data-testid='fillblank-option-910835-1-fever'>fever</option><option value=\"stomachache\" data-testid='fillblank-option-910835-1-stomachache'>stomachache</option><option value=\"strain\" data-testid='fillblank-option-910835-1-strain'>strain</option></select></span></strong>, which happens when a muscle is overused and gets injured. Poor <strong><span class='fillblank-option'><label>14.3</label><select class='ms fillblank-option-14' index='2' name='fbo-910835-2' data-testid='fillblank-select-910835-2'><option value='' data-testid='fillblank-option-empty-910835-2'></option><option value=\"schedule\" data-testid='fillblank-option-910835-2-schedule